                <pb facs="0279" n="269" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg269"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.48/1444: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hayes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-03-13T22:00:00+01:00">March 13, 1943—10
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 14—3:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>608. My 576, March 10, midnight. Rapidly increasing proportions of refugee relief
                    problem make it extremely difficult even approximately to estimate future needs
                    but it now appears that Embassy requirements for next 30 days will exceed
                    $150,000.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hayes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
